    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `extract_invoice_fields.py` file, I need to integrate a concrete external provider for extracting fields from an invoice. I will use Amazon Textract, a service that automatically extracts text and data from scanned documents. This service is identifiable by the use of the `boto3` library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, and the specific calls to the Textract service. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789866821357,
          "start": 1789866816690
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc6034b2001WspfwxdqHpgJNC",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc602e03001yad347xvInbsBo",
      "session_id": "ses_f439fd27bffeGnkvoebUF7P6gg",
